\end_inset

 (
\begin_inset Flex Code
status collapsed

\begin_layout Plain Layout
hbar
\end_layout

\end_inset

 
\begin_inset Formula $=1$
\end_inset

 in 
\begin_inset Flex Code
status collapsed

\begin_layout Plain Layout
common/constants.f90
\end_layout

\end_inset

);
 the factors of 
\begin_inset Formula $\hbar$
\end_inset

 are kept in the equations below and in the source,
 so that they can be restored.
 
\begin_inset Formula $k_{B}=8.6173303\times10^{-5}$
\end_inset


\begin_inset space ~
